{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Peter Visits Vanessa in San Francisco"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "This Line of Work"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 4}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs in common social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "PlaceholderUnderstands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Asking and Giving Permission"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you ask for permission, it is important to be polite."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You often use a modal like <span class=\"italic\">can, may, could</span> or <span class=\"italic\">would</span> to ask for permission."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can also ask a Yes or No question like <span class=\"italic\">\u201cIs it OK if ... \u201d</span> or <span class=\"italic\">\u201cDo you mind ... \u201d</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here are some ways to ask for and give permission."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Asking for Permission </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Giving Permission </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could I take a few days off next week?<br /> Can I ask you something?<br /> Would it be alright if I change projects?<br /> Do you mind if someone takes my shifts next week?<br /> Is it OK if I leave early today?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure.<br />  Perhaps.<br />  Of course.<br />  No problem.<br />  I don't mind.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Showing Flexibility (Possibility)"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can express possibility using a modal like <span class=\"italic\">might</span> or <span class=\"italic\">may</span>.  You can also use some words and expressions like it's a <span class=\"italic\">possibility</span> or <span class=\"italic\">there's a chance</span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Nancy might agree."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Frank may want to work on that project. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Perhaps John will work with us. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Maybe Heather is interested in changing shifts."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "workload"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the amount of work a person or group of people must complete"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  The workload is pretty heavy during the Christmas season."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le04ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about work."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "line of work"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "industry; field; area of business"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's a reality in our line of work."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le04ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "shift "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the time a person is scheduled to work in one day"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Could somebody take some of my shifts next week? "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le04ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "extended hours"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " longer periods of work than what is normally the case"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I could do extended hours when I get back."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le04ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "possibility"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "chance"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What you are suggesting is a possibility."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le04ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "short of staff"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not having enough employees to do the work"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I don't want to be short of staff. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le04ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le04ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, choose 3 different lines of work to discuss. Choose general areas of work, like healthcare or travel, not specific jobs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss those lines of work. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Complete the table."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Which line of work do you find interesting? Explain why."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Line of work: <br/>&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Line of work: <br/>&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Line of work: <br/>&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When it is very busy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When it is not busy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\